<title>FRANCE: British climber dies on Mont Blanc.</title>
<headline>British climber dies on Mont Blanc.</headline>
<dateline>GRENOBLE, France 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 47-year-old Briton fell to his death on a glacier while on his way to Mont Blanc, Europe's highest mountain, on Saturday, police said.</p>
<p>They did not release his identity.</p>
</text>
